{"data": {"access_mode": "standard", "kind": "fix", "scope_hint": ["04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/config.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/ui/controllers/home_ui_controller.py"], "statement": "Project open/create QFileDialog calls default to the application install root (config.APP_ROOT), which for a frozen build installed into a non-writable location opens the project browser inside the read-only install directory; default instead to a resolved per-user documents directory (falling back to the home directory) when no project is open."}, "event": "run.started", "time": "2026-07-25T16:14:40+00:00"}
